Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Date: 15 MAY 2020 - 

About:

The content of this subdirectory does not correspond to
actual patches, my rather the namelist(s) I have used to run
simulations.

Initial conditions: Initial conditions are expected in the
output directory (output_dir), within a subdirectory 'ic',
i.e. <initfile> = <output_dir>/ic

The idea is that the output directory, i.e. the ic directory
and any of the output_xxxxx directories together contain
all the necessary information and data to reproduce the
corresponding simulation.

IMPORTANT:
- initfile dir name must be such that expanded by the IC file names
collectively has len < 80 characters
- output_dir name MUST have len < 40 characters to accomodate
the longest Ramses output file names,
such as output_xxxxx/part_file_descriptor.txt !
